hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"229","[AI-translation] Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) jab khushi ki baat aati to kehte: Sari tareefein us Allah ke liye hain jis ki nemat se nekiyan mukammal hoti hain. Aur jab napasand baat aati to kehte: Har haal mein Allah ki tareef hai. [Khushi ya pareshani par kahe]"
